    "created_at": "2026-07-15T16:27:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-15T16:28:47Z",
    "body": "The spec attempts to block capturing groups in regexps.  See step 4.8.5.6.5 (my kingdom for links to steps...) in:\n\nhttps://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#tokenize\n\nLink to highlight: https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#tokenize:~:text=If%20tokenizer%E2%80%99s%20code%20point%20is%20not%20U,start%2C%20and%20tokenizer%E2%80%99s%20index.\n\nI think this example bypasses the proactive check by nesting the capturing group below the top level.\n\nNote, the example pattern doesn't work in path-to-regexp 1.7 or 2.0 either according to: https://forbeslindesay.github.io/express-route-tester/",
